# Normalisasi line ending ke LF agar cocok dengan CI (Linux) dan produksi.
# Test CSP hash dan template membandingkan byte mentah, sehingga CRLF
# menyebabkan kegagalan palsu saat checkout di Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary